[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0010","text":"『────美琴？\n　辛苦了，怎么了？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0020","text":"……有点事想商量"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0030","text":"之前给我看过资料的『公开练习』…………\n还能答复吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0040","text":"『没问题哦\n　……你要参加吗？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0050","text":"……嗯\n可以拜托你吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0060","text":"『当然！　我联系一下对方』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0070","text":"嗯……\n谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0080","text":"『其实我本来都打算帮你推掉了\n　因为你看起来不太感兴趣────』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0090","text":"是……没错……\n……但只有这个…………只有这个我能想到…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0100","text":"『…………嗯\n　赶上了，还好你联系了我』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0110","text":"还有……————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0120","text":"啊，不用"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0130","text":"『怎么了？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0140","text":"……现在还是算了\n等我决定好怎么做，再跟你商量"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0150","text":"『────了解』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0160","text":"『那个，美琴……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0170","text":"什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0180","text":"『……谢谢你，为我考虑了这么多』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_04_0190","text":"……嗯"}]
